flowchart TD
    A[Intake: question, model, intervention, comparator, endpoint] --> B{Research-question Gate}
    B -- unresolved --> B1[Record open decision or assumption]
    B1 --> B
    B -- bounded --> C[Comprehensive review and evidence matrix]
    C --> D{Saturation Check}
    D -- not saturated --> C
    D -- documented --> E{Evidence Gate}
    E -- blocked --> E1[Mark parameter UNRESOLVED or PILOT-REQUIRED]
    E1 --> F[Roadmap with ideal and feasible designs]
    E -- pass or blockers --> F
    F --> G{Phase-selection Gate}
    G -- no phase --> G1[Request PI or user decision]
    G1 --> G
    G -- phase selected --> H{Feasibility Gate}
    H -- blocked --> H1[Record missing resource or safety decision]
    H1 --> H
    H -- feasible --> I[Protocol: groups, preparation, procedure, endpoints, statistics]
    I --> J{Quality and Ethics Gate}
    J -- blocked --> J1[Escalate for institutional, biosafety, welfare, or regulatory review]
    J1 --> J
    J -- pass or blockers --> K{Citation Integrity Gate}
    K -- unsupported parameter --> K1[Remove from executable protocol or require pilot]
    K1 --> I
    K -- traceable --> L[Finalize artifacts and append-only audit trail]
